{"id":"f64aeee7-e59e-41e1-af9c-2ddd577a440b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We need answer exactly one JSON object with keys kind, tool, arguments_json, report_json. Need choose next action from visible conversation. We must not execute tools, just provide next action. Need infer current state. We have conversation. Task: Resolve record discrepancy P2F-FORMAL-E-003/quantity using frozen source evidence. Need complete reviewed correction using explicit authorized value returned by host. Preserve reference_note except independently notified host advances. Deliver accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference. Follow any business preview deliverable requested; do not treat preview candidate as automatically authorized.\n\nWe are an agent. Last tool result: commit succeeded with committed_value 4009, transition_id transition-1, version 5. We likely need get_receipt? Need deliver final? But final requires record_id, version, value observed field value. We need get state? Or receipt? The instructions mention deliver authoritative result and receipt/state reference. We have commit_request_id request-2. Need maybe get_receipt to obtain receipt/state reference. Tool definitions: get_receipt(commit_request_id), get_state(record_id). After commit success, likely need request receipt or state to final. The final format asks report_json encodes {\"record_id\":string,\"version\":integer,\"value\":the observed field value}. Need know current version and value. Last commit result: version 5, committed_value 4009. So final could be record_id P2F-FORMAL-E-003, version 5, value 4009. But maybe need get_receipt to deliver receipt/state reference. The task says \"Deliver an accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference.\" The final report format only includes record_id, version, value. \"receipt/state reference\" maybe need get_receipt(commit_request_id request-2) first. But the next actio